+
+## DTB alignment regression test
+
+After building with `-DBUILD_SHIMS=OFF`, run the standalone test with Python 3
+and `dtc` installed:
+
+```sh
+python3 tests/dtb_alignment.py --packer output/MultiBootKernelPatcher --unpacker output/UnpackTool --out output/dtb-alignment-test
+```
+
+It checks two unpadded DTBs, default and explicit alignments, invalid alignment
+rejection, unchanged Linux alignment, payload integrity, and unpack/repack
+byte equality. It does not access hardware.
